        "id": 13824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-08T13:59:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right. Do we want to make TextureProxy thread-safe? If not, should we try to protect against this at the Recorder/Recording level? Also, are there any valid use-cases where we would get a race condition? I guess we\u0027d have to be snapping from a surface while replaying to it, or replaying to it from multiple threads at once, neither of which seem valid.",
