      "writtenOn": "2022-12-08T18:12:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay so talking with Rob, apparently we had already discussed this a couple months ago. If we instantiate all SkSurface proxies at creation time, then we should never hit this issue. I think today we may defer instantiation until snapRecording time. But I think it is fine to just instantiation them immediately in the SkSurface factories for graphite.",
